# GitHub Linguist overrides — keep the language bar about the app itself.
# Note: `*` does not cross a `/`, so these need `**`.
# https://github.com/github-linguist/linguist/blob/main/docs/overrides.md

# The website: mostly Mud's own export output, plus a hand-written index.
Site/**                 linguist-documentation

# Golden render fixtures. Vendored, not generated — `generated` would
# collapse them in diffs, and those diffs are the point of a golden test.
Core/Tests/Golden/**    linguist-vendored

# No effect on stats (these are `data` types), but collapses the diffs.
Mud.xcodeproj/**        linguist-generated
